[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11127.55, "timestamp": "03:05:27", "text": "我是谁？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11139.51, "timestamp": "03:05:39", "text": "等待。哦，我其实是进行了一次双重突袭。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11142.389, "timestamp": "03:05:42", "text": "他们的共同朋友。好的。好的。我当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11145.03, "timestamp": "03:05:45", "text": "先观察一会儿。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11147.83, "timestamp": "03:05:47", "text": "那是创建模式吗？嗯，也就是 Aka。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11150.07, "timestamp": "03:05:50", "text": "跟我说的是？我的天哪，看起来好棒！"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11152.07, "timestamp": "03:05:52", "text": "好的。另外，那也是一个创建模拟市民的功能。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11153.37, "timestamp": "03:05:53", "text": "有点儿"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11155.63, "timestamp": "03:05:55", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11159.349, "timestamp": "03:05:59", "text": "事物。是的，看起来不错。我不想"}]